    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I'm using LazyVim, and I'm trying to delete one or more files.\r\n\r\nI see the files deleted in the mini.files window, and then I press `=` but nothing happens.\r\n\r\nI tried quitting it and hoping it would synchronize the changes but nope.\r\n\r\nWhat am I doing wrong here? I just want to edit/delete buffers?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I'm using LazyVim, and I'm trying to delete one or more files.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I see the files deleted in the mini.files window, and then I press <code class=\"notranslate\">=</code> but nothing happens.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I tried quitting it and hoping it would synchronize the changes but nope.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">What am I doing wrong here? I just want to edit/delete buffers?</p>",
    "bodyText": "I'm using LazyVim, and I'm trying to delete one or more files.\nI see the files deleted in the mini.files window, and then I press = but nothing happens.\nI tried quitting it and hoping it would synchronize the changes but nope.\nWhat am I doing wrong here? I just want to edit/delete buffers?",
