            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> What am I doing wrong here? I just want to edit/delete buffers?\r\n\r\nSorry, there is not enough reproducible steps to answer anything other than \"*Probably* *something* is done wrong\".\r\n\r\nPressing `=` when explorer is open should synchronize changes with file system after confirmation dialog.",
            "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">What am I doing wrong here? I just want to edit/delete buffers?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Sorry, there is not enough reproducible steps to answer anything other than \"<em>Probably</em> <em>something</em> is done wrong\".</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Pressing <code class=\"notranslate\">=</code> when explorer is open should synchronize changes with file system after confirmation dialog.</p>",
            "bodyText": "What am I doing wrong here? I just want to edit/delete buffers?\n\nSorry, there is not enough reproducible steps to answer anything other than \"Probably something is done wrong\".\nPressing = when explorer is open should synchronize changes with file system after confirmation dialog.",
